tion/answer-fields ["q-134002/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "327d9a77-b2dd-57b1-b959-570684714bf9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-134002"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-134018/selection/0750c881e73df9fa127e5386b05faec04ae6877b5b593c6183e20210f4cfa47e" :answer/id #uuid "e0c246b1-c992-5b8d-9100-2e2445bb3873" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{5}{4}x+\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134018/selection/b87caf80912cebded728ff69a4b64e1bf3e1008744d7c1b13d24c8d20c74e0e7" :answer/id #uuid "a979bc2b-baa7-51f5-a3d6-a1ab523153bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{7}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134018/selection/2da4d7ffeaf1ddd52fe665650451e6b416e4ead688a3d1e65915b952970bb27a" :answer/id #uuid "8da67108-2ac1-5f4e-a49c-1a86dd6a2379" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{5}{4}x+\\frac{7}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134018/selection/c5d59bd63027e6495f824fbc982580a48a12b742e9588f2c0a61dff7ce186011" :answer/id #uuid "1fbca36b-7ac1-5de4-a1b1-69dea8659a2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{5}{4}x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134018/selection/259aa7523901a2f4b158e2b20c09927a05dea95c3f46f4672711c1d486a00953" :answer/id #uuid "db36ddb0-75ca-5efa-aaaa-4708bf13a43e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{3}{2}x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134018/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3582ab5a-e997-56cf-93d5-82b7fd486779" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-134018/selection/2da4d7ffeaf1ddd52fe665650451e6b416e4ead688a3d1e65915b952970bb27a" :answer-field/choices ["q-134018/selection/0750c881e73df9fa127e5386b05faec04ae6877b5b593c6183e20210f4cfa47e" "q-134018/selection/b87caf80912cebded728ff69a4b64e1bf3e1008744d7c1b13d24c8d20c74e0e7" "q-134018/selection/2da4d7ffeaf1ddd52fe665650451e6b416e4ead688a3d1e65915b952970bb27a" "q-134018/selection/c5d59bd63027e6495f824fbc982580a48a12b742e9588f2c0a61dff7ce186011" "q-134018/selection/259aa7523901a2f4b158e2b20c09927a05dea95c3f46f4672711c1d486a00953"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-134018" :question/id #uuid "b1a6666b-a452-503d-ac89-478427988482" :question/math-academy-id "q-134018" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010570/assets/da0836fa401981d7a0a254a136036a0ead7e3be8eefff5ef3fdfb31070759f0a.png)\n\nDetermine the equation of the trend line shown above." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the trend line passes through the points $({x}_{1},{y}_{1})=(1,3)$ and $({x}_{2},{y}_{2})=(5,8).$\n\nWe will write the equation of the line in the slope-intercept form \n\n$$\ny=mx+b.\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute the slope $m$ of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & =\\frac{{y}_{2}-{y}_{1}}{{x}_{2}-{x}_{1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8-3}{5-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $m=\\frac{5}{4}$ into the slope-intercept form above, we get\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{5}{4}x+b.\n$$\n\nWe now need to find the $y$-intercept $b.$ We can find this by substituting the coordinates of a point on the line. Any point will do, so let's substitute $(1,3):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\frac{5}{4}x+b \\\\ 3 & =\\frac{5}{4}(1)+b \\\\ 3 & =\\frac{5}{4}+b \\\\ 12 & =5+4b \\\\ 7 & =4b \\\\ b & =\\frac{7}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the line is \n\n$$\ny=\\frac{5}{4}x+\\frac{7}{4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-134018/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "63426ad7-4275-5ac3-854d-e91ec00dcbe3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-134018"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-134025/selection/a39e4c3855e119cc134cd501616b2d4242dd33fe6134da1d7da0776d673411f7" :answer/id #uuid "11017683-60b7-5bf6-a679-a92f5b4af3b6" :an