s/c8f6d0161777412704a9a80c0336af04a6968454d421913055024b6d0cf11c71.png)\n\nEstimate the slope of the trend line for the scatter plot above. Round your answer to the nearest $0.5.$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's draw an approximate trend line for our scatter plot:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14010570/assets/b50fd1636cc2e1bb9d150eaba9cc25a3ccedff77e607bf22853004332a7c4ddc.png)\n\nIt seems that the trend line passes through $({x}_{1},{y}_{1})≈(3,6)$ and $({x}_{2},{y}_{2})≈(5,3).$\n\nTherefore, we estimate the slope $m$ of the line as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & ≈\\frac{{y}_{2}-{y}_{1}}{{x}_{2}-{x}_{1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3-6}{5-3} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3}{2} \\\\  & =-1.5\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-134025/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "890526df-fd1a-5340-8732-efc0c1a1b0ae"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-134025"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-134026/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "cd007cd3-aa6c-50df-b2d6-54602fc7eb8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134026/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "995a2444-73cb-559a-ac3b-eabe38374d65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134026/selection/03a4102f13ad3e0ac65ab53676c3f89cede3c650c4dd4e31a2b43a62847e184f" :answer/id #uuid "883eddbf-117e-5ffd-9cbe-efe7a5a1ea7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2.5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134026/selection/9b32bd1c2d85515eb67bf6ed1aa42ff7a66b88544eaafce7b11ad994fbde1d11" :answer/id #uuid "c258ab7b-bce5-5168-a472-b548cc7fa410" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1.5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134026/selection/f80